                <h3><b>Technical Debt and Backlog Management</b></h3>

                <p>
                    Product backlogs should not focus only on customer-facing features.
                    Technical debt, architecture improvements, security updates, performance
                    enhancements, infrastructure work, and maintenance activities can also
                    have a significant impact on product quality and long-term scalability.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
