                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Include important architecture and infrastructure improvements in the backlog.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Prioritize security and performance improvements according to their business and technical impact.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Balance technical work with customer-facing product improvements.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Track technical initiatives as part of the broader product roadmap.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

